<title>MONGOLIA: MONGOLIA'S TUGRIK DOWN 0.3 PCT VS DOLLAR TO MONDAY.</title>
<headline>MONGOLIA'S TUGRIK DOWN 0.3 PCT VS DOLLAR TO MONDAY.</headline>
<dateline>ULAN BATOR 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mongolian tugrik was down 0.29 percent against the dollar on Monday compared with the previous Monday, central bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The Bank of Mongolia said the tugrik had fallen to 804.36 against the U.S. currency, from 802.02 a week ago.</p>
<p>The central bank calculates the official rate based on the previous week's interbank trade.</p>
<p>-- Ulan Bator Newsroom (9761) 312-565</p>
